 Miscellaneous
 -------------
 
+* The ``fail_silently``, ``auth_user`` and ``auth_password`` arguments of
+  :func:`~django.core.mail.send_mail`,
+  :func:`~django.core.mail.send_mass_mail` and
+  :meth:`.EmailMessage.send` were previously ignored when ``connection`` was
+  also provided. A :exc:`TypeError` is now raised in that case. Pass these
+  options to :func:`~django.core.mail.get_connection` instead.
+
 * :class:`~django.contrib.contenttypes.fields.GenericForeignKey` now uses a
   separate descriptor class: the private ``GenericForeignKeyDescriptor``.
 
